{"ts":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Priority order\n\n1. Priority-zero and priority-one stories and decisions.\n2. SDK-first and CLI simplification delivery chains.\n3. Context engine, scale, history integrity, releases, packages, and governance.\n4. Remaining active features, tasks, chores, plans, issues, and reminders.\n\n## Batch contract\n\nSnapshot; claim; bounded finding set; exact operations; dry-run validation; mutation; post-checks; evidence comment; metric delta; cursor checkpoint; release."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-qnl2"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Wave 1 active graph enrichment: connect strategic stories, decisions, delivery slices, evidence, and execution order from reviewed findings"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Apply only high-confidence, evidence-backed relationship changes to active items and verify each bounded batch before continuing."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["active-items","backfill","graph","relationships","task","wave:1"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":720},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Consume only reviewed Wave 0 findings and accepted edge semantics; every operation includes source evidence, confidence, author, and rationale; Prioritize story-to-delivery, decision-to-implementation, prerequisite ordering, discovered-from, evidence, release, incident, and SDK-to-adapter relationships; Partition work by canonical lineage and bounded item count so agents can claim non-overlapping batches and resume from durable cursors; Each batch runs duplicate, semantic graph, lifecycle, history-drift, and health validation and records graph-quality and token-context deltas; Low-confidence and conflicting cases remain investigations or waivers; no generic related edge is added solely for connectivity; Finish when every active item has a reviewed classification and either valid relationships, an intentional-isolate waiver, or an explicit remediation owner"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make active execution and strategy lineages richly traversable without adding arbitrary density"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Agents gain reliable prerequisite, delivery, decision, evidence, and impact paths for current work first"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Improves claim-next, planning, context assembly, duplicate prevention, handoffs, and blast-radius reasoning"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Reviewed active-item relationship batches with before and after metrics, immutable evidence, and no unexplained policy violations"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Active work has the highest context value and lowest changelog risk, while several bodies already provide direct evidence for missing prerequisites"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-a8zm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-1kxs","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"id":"pm-4jqm","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"id":"pm-4k6b","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"id":"pm-6x7o","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"id":"pm-p9a4","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-13T22:00:05.456Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Duplicate check 2026-07-13: no existing open item owns systematic evidence-backed active-item relationship enrichment across capability lineages; existing epics own their features while this task owns only cross-lineage graph remediation batches."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"7842f6fae55570dda8588b1f019a8e7abcfcb18d6e4904d93ac0596892ba3adb","message":"Create Wave 1 active graph enrichment task"}
